Z||000007||The Fieromaster||07-23-2001||02:48 AM||||I would have to agree with Decadence.. Unless your Fiero is slightly modded... I was in my buddies Probe GT (1993) and another buddy was in my Fiero GT (my old 85) and well he whooped on the Probe i was driving.. but uh.. he shouldnt have had any 2nd gear left when he did downshift my Fiero... that worries me...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>My Fiero had cam, no cat, and modded heads!<BR>Probe had no muffler!<P>Puttin that motor in my 85GT fastback as we speak!<P>------------------<BR>      <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT><BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">        <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT></B>||||reg||13
