Z||000009||Fformula88||07-23-2001||05:27 PM||||The Probe may win but not by a whole lot.  It has more HP (164) but is also pulling around more weight too.  It would also come down to driver abilities.  The Probe's FWD layout will hurt its acceleration off the line vs the Fiero.  I think the Probe hits 60 in about 7.5 seconds with a good driver, which is about where the stock Fiero clocks in.<P>I do know a Probe SE (4 cyl) will take a Fiero with the iron duke.  My father's old 87 Fiero was easily slower than my 97 Probe SE.  <P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
