Z||000011||DecadenceR||07-23-2001||08:30 PM||||Count - I'm sure you could habe. As with any car, half of the race is in the driver.<BR>A stock Z28 has more HP and torque than a stock 'Stang 5.0. However, plenty of stangs beat Z28's. Just gotta know how to handle it right, ya know?||||reg||1
Z||000012||GT-maniac||07-23-2001||11:21 PM||||I raced a friend in a 97 Probe GT with my 85 GT and I easily kicked his ass. At around 100 or so, he was pretty much flat out and I still had lots of pedal left. He pulled away at first but once I hit second I easily caught him and passed. A lot of these newer cars seem to have artificially low top speeds. The ford super duties for instance top out at 100 mph at least with the 5.4||||reg||1
